[{"answer":"Hello... are you Professor Van Diezen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am. And who might you be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh! Sorry, my name is Tina. I'm a freshman here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/3.mp3"},{"answer":"They told me I should ask you for advice in choosing courses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's part of what I'm here for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Please come in and sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what are your questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I, I almost don't know!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Everything is so confusing!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Like what is a specialised course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, easy. A specialised course is one that is compulsory,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/11.mp3"},{"answer":"meaning it's a requirement for your major and regular,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/12-2019-04-13-09-43-35.mp3"},{"answer":"so you can't place out by taking a proficiency exam.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds pretty strict.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Then what are all these general courses?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I seem to have to take so many.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Nothing to be alarmed over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/17.mp3"},{"answer":"These are courses open to all students and not directly related to your major.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The university offers these general courses to choose","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/19.mp3"},{"answer":"so that you can become more well-rounded individuals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/20-2019-04-13-09-56-10.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, I see you're a Microbiology major.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So it might be a good idea to take some literature or history courses","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/22.mp3"},{"answer":"so that you can know something besides all science.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/23.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean these courses are, like, for fun?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That might be one way to look at it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but don't tell the literature professor such a thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Think of a general course as the opposite of a specified course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/27.mp3"},{"answer":"A specified course is one that pertains directly to your major.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So can I take any Microbiology course I want?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, those courses used to be open to Microbiology students only.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The good thing is, now it's open to students on a flexible schedule,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's not only for full-time students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/33.mp3"},{"answer":"So the answer is yes, if you have the instructor's permission.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/34.mp3"},{"answer":"May I ask you why you chose Microbiology?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I also like plain old Biology, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, full sized animals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I might even become a veterinarian.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I take some Biology classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they are open to full-time students only,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/40.mp3"},{"answer":"which I believe is what you are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know how a freshman would get along with Microbiology, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, most of the students presently looking into it are from off-campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Off-campus?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you know, people who use it in their work at hospitals, laboratories, even a police detective.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Why did you choose Microbiology, if I may ask?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think you've quite answered that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, eventually I want to be a doctor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/48.mp3"},{"answer":"At least my dad tells me so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/49.mp3"},{"answer":"If I may say so, young lady, you seem a little uncertain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Still, I think that might be a good idea for a career.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, if you're thinking about being either a doctor or a vet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/52.mp3"},{"answer":"you should take some Medical Science classes before you even think of applying to med school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Great! What should I take?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/54.mp3"},{"answer":"There is one small problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The new Medical Sciences building is under construction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/56.mp3"},{"answer":"so there are no experimental facilities available until next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid you'll have to wait.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/58.mp3"},{"answer":"But don't forget to take those courses at the first opportunity!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, bummer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there any other course you'd recommend for someone like me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, since you seem to like animals,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/62.mp3"},{"answer":"have you ever thought about looking into Environmental Science?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/63.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I never really thought about it before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it worthwhile?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Quite! In fact, it's the fastest growing subject on this campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry, I couldn't help noticing the long list of classes you've written out there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/67.mp3"},{"answer":"May I have a look?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Medical Science, Statistics, Laboratory Techniques,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Medicine, Mathematics, Computing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/71-2019-04-13-14-33-40.mp3"},{"answer":"My, my, a bit of everything here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it too much?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/73.mp3"},{"answer":"For your first semester, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/74.mp3"},{"answer":"What I suggest is starting out by taking the compulsory courses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Like we said before, the Medical Science can wait.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Consider taking that in your sophomore year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'd put off Computing, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I recommend to all freshmen that I talk to","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/79.mp3"},{"answer":"to get the compulsory Mathematics out of the way as early as possible,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/80-2019-04-13-14-40-32.mp3"},{"answer":"so take that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/81.mp3"},{"answer":"It'll be one less difficult course you have to focus on when the science lab opens next year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/82.mp3"},{"answer":"and you have to catch up on classes like Laboratory Techniques.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Your major also requires Statistics so you have to balance two Math classes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/84.mp3"},{"answer":"and no doubt you should take that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Otherwise, get your required Medicine course out of the way by taking something theory-based.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, of course and your Environmental Science class if you're interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/87.mp3"},{"answer":"The others can wait, though I think Computing is definitely a good idea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/88.mp3"},{"answer":"even though it's not required.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I see too, on your paper there, you seem to have had high marks on the entrance exam.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhhh, yeah. I guess so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't be shy! Have you thought about applying for a scholarship?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/92.mp3"},{"answer":"Do they have any?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/93.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, my dad is always complaining about how much money it costs him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/94.mp3"},{"answer":"In your department, there are actually three full scholarships available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/95.mp3"},{"answer":"They cover tuition and provide $1,500 cash.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/96.mp3"},{"answer":"$1,500 cash?! Party!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Please, Miss. The money is intended more as a textbook allowance, not party money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/98.mp3"},{"answer":"If you promise to behave, I'll show you how to apply.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/99.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, and thanks!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-3-2019-03-17-15-15-32/100.mp3"}]
